NOTICE — what is deliberately NOT in this repository
=====================================================

This project contains research notes, GPL kernel patches and MIT mesa patches only.
The following material was intentionally excluded. None of it is required to read or
understand the research; the docs describe how to obtain it from your own device.

1. Proprietary firmware and vendor binaries (no redistribution license):
   - Samsung/Qualcomm: boot images, dtbo images, ABL/firmware dumps, vendor partition
     contents, camera HAL libraries (camera.qcom.so, com.samsung.chi.override.so,
     libTOFProc_interface.so, ...), sensor modules, ADSP/MPSS/SLPI firmware images.
   - Broadcom: WLAN firmware (bcmdhd), BT patchram (bcm4375B1_murata.hcd), NVRAM.
   - Qualcomm GPU firmware (a630_sqe.fw, a640_gmu.bin).
   - Any unmapped "blob" dumps (.raw frames, .so files, .bin dumps).

2. Per-device secrets:
   - SSH host/device private keys.
   - wpa_supplicant.conf with plaintext Wi-Fi PSKs.

3. Device-specific calibration data (IMEI-adjacent, per-unit):
   - modemst/EFS dumps, persist partition contents, sensor calibration blobs.

4. Large build artifacts:
   - Kernel object trees, rootfs/chroot images, boot image binaries, .deb/.tar caches.

If you are the rights holder of something you believe should be here or not here, open an
issue.

Licensing of what IS here: kernel patches are GPL-2.0 (Samsung SM8150 kernel lineage);
mesa deltas are MIT (Mesa); everything written by this project (docs, scripts, configs)
is offered under CC BY-SA 4.0 unless a file states otherwise.